{"id":"cuanto","lemma":"cuanto","pos":"det","rank":388,"glosses":["as much [of]; as many; however much; however many","few; quite a few; a handful","however much; however many; (constructing parallel comparatives) “the..., the...”"],"ipa":"/ˈkwanto/","forms":{"plural":"cuantos","feminine":"cuanta","femininePlural":"cuantas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cuanto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cuanto más hagas, mejor.","en":"The more you do, the better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/532144","words":[null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"better"}]},{"text":"Lo necesito cuanto antes.","en":"I need it as soon as possible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/296201","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null,{"g":"earlier"}]},{"text":"Ella tiene unos cuantos amigos.","en":"She has a few friends.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706232","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"about, approximately"},null,{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"}]},{"text":"Sé unas cuantas cosas.","en":"I know a few things.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/138010","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"an","l":"un"},null,{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"}]},{"text":"Tengo que hacer unas cuantas cosas.","en":"I have a few things I need to do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604720","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"an","l":"un"},null,{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"}]}]}